sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User/DataFrame
    participant V as LLMAnnotationValidator
    participant CM as AnnotationContextManager
    participant TF as TextFetcher
    participant PR as PromptRouter
    participant IS as LLMInteractionService
    participant LLM as LLM API (Ollama/OpenAI)

    U->>V: process_dataframe(df)
    V->>V: _normalise_schema(df)
    V->>V: verify_service_availability()

    loop for each row
        V->>CM: get_prepared_context(row)
        CM->>TF: fetch(row, source_key)
        TF-->>CM: raw_text
        CM-->>V: context_text, span_note

        loop for each enabled task (e.g., negated, temporality)
            V->>PR: get_template(row, task_id)
            PR-->>V: prompt_template
            V->>IS: call_single_task_llm(prompt_template, ...)
            IS->>IS: _call_with_retry(prompt)
            IS->>LLM: call(prompt)
            LLM-->>IS: response_text
            IS->>IS: _parse_response_for_task(response_text)
            IS-->>V: task_output (value, reason)
            V->>V: Adjudicate vs MedCAT prediction
        end
        V->>V: Derive final llm_status
    end
    V-->>U: Return Validated DataFrame
